WEBVTT

00:03:26.827 --> 00:03:30.414
who can think and act entrepreneurially.

00:03:31.123 --> 00:03:35.461
Kids who have the opportunity
or have the skill set

00:03:35.503 --> 00:03:39.423
to view the world
from an entrepreneurial mindset.

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:43.594
So let me tell you
how I came to this conclusion.

00:03:45.346 --> 00:03:47.181
So for more than 20 years,

00:03:47.223 --> 00:03:52.186
my work was centered around supporting
adult entrepreneurs.

00:03:53.312 --> 00:03:56.274
Providing them with training
and technical assistance

00:03:56.315 --> 00:04:00.027
and resources to help them start
and grow their businesses.